  "ja104:1.1": "Catubbhi aṭṭh' ajjhagamā ",
  "ja104:1.2": "aṭṭhāhi pi ca soḷasa ",
  "ja104:1.3": "soḷasāhi ca battiṃsā, ",
  "ja104:1.4": "atricchaṃ cakkam āsado, ",
  "ja104:1.5": "icchāhatassa posassa ",
  "ja104:1.6": "cakkaṃ bhamati matthaketi. ",
